        },
        {
          "id": "b-5ykvp8",
          "type": "specs",
          "items": [
            {
              "label": "Owned",
              "value": "· The scoring formula\n· Star tiers and phase-pass rules\n· Golden Fork reward\n· World 1 score simulation\n· Balance documentation"
            },
            {
              "label": "Studio",
              "value": "· Recipe and phase design with level design"
            },
            {
              "label": "Engine",
              "value": "· UI creation on the results screen\n· Engineering on score implementation"
            }
          ],
          "arrange": "stack"
        },
        {
          "id": "b-56wewj",
          "type": "spacer",
          "size": "sm"
        },
        {
          "id": "b-n79bax",
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<p></p><div><b><span class=\"big\">In Short</span></b></div><div><ul><li><b>What I Owned: </b>The system that turns a delivered dish into a score, a star rating and a pass or fail for the next phase.</li><li><b>Hardest Problems: </b>The model showed that speed barely affected the score and the top reward was out of reach: every perfect order scored ★★★, and no player could ever earn the Golden Fork.</li><li><b>What it Shows: </b>Designing a scoring system from first principles and using simulation to check that the stars actually separate good play from great play.</li></ul></div><p></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "b-a3nrzk",
          "type": "spacer",
          "size": "md"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-jdvgur",
      "type": "section",
      "background": "none",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "b-b3zt8j",
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Constraints & Problem Solving"
        },
        {
          "id": "b-ixknk3",
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<p><ul><li><b>One score has to judge accuracy and speed,</b> across recipes of very different size and length.</li><li><b>Stars gate progression, </b>so a tier threshold is also a difficulty setting.</li><li><b>Every recipe needs the same star rules, </b>without hand-tuning each phase.</li></ul></p><p></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "b-cxakp2",
          "type": "spacer",
          "size": "sm"
        }
      ]
    },
