        {
          "id": "b-1cvl7c",
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Design Pillars"
        },
        {
          "id": "b-792qho",
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<p></p><ol><li><b>Right Before Fast:</b> A correct dish always beats a fast, wrong one.</li><li><b>Fair Across Recipes:</b> A two-ingredient snack and a five-course dish are judged on the same scale.</li><li><b>Mastery Has a Trophy:</b> The best players get a reward the rest can see and chase.</li></ol><p></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "b-wbkotk",
          "type": "spacer",
          "size": "sm"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
